{
  "slug": "unbound",
  "name": "Unbound",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Use Claude Code without fear of data leakage. Unbound enforces command policies, DLP and jailbreak guardrails, and streams session analytics to your security dashboard — all with zero-latency fail-open design.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `setup` (Configure Unbound AI credentials and verify connectivity for the Claude Code plugin)\n- **Hooks** (4): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install unbound@claude-community` from `websentry-ai/claude-code-plugin`.",
